§§ `For the owner or occupier: s 19 consequences and costs`

-- What may the council do (s 19(3), (4))? No notice: nothing under s 19. Obliterated: nothing. Same notice, asked on
-- 10 or 15 March: nothing yet. On 16 March, notice to me: obliterate and recover from me; notice to my tenant while I
-- own: from the tenant.
