#ASSERT `What may the local government do if the notice is not complied with` `as the owner or occupier` `given to me, I own` TRUE `an unasked date` `an unasked number` `an unasked date` EQUALS `nothing: the graffiti has been obliterated`
#ASSERT `What may the local government do if the notice is not complied with` `as the owner or occupier` `given to me, I own` FALSE `1 March 2027` 14 `10 March 2027` EQUALS `nothing yet: the time in the notice has not run out`
